  "description": "The GLM dialect of the Compendium AI adapters: recognises a GLM model (Z.ai's open-weight family) whatever the host's prefix, knows its reasoning and limits, shapes the request (reasoning effort, max_tokens with room for the reasoning) and normalises what comes back (the reasoning apart, never in the answer). Pure logic, no HTTP, no endpoint: the Z.ai, Mistral and OpenRouter adapters use it for the GLM models they serve.",
